WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:01.530
Hi, everybody.

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:03.770
My name is Ranger Connie and I am reporting live

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.020
from Grand Canyon National Park.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.210
And I am an education ranger here.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.090
I pretty much give programs and lessons

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:13.090
to students like yourself from K through 12.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.840
And that's one of my favorite things to do

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.780
is actually to teach the public about these really beautiful

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:18.560
places.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.500
And the second part is I get to travel to different parks,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.470
like here I'm in the Grand Canyon National Park

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.940
and now I'm here in Yosemite.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.040
So here I'm also an education ranger.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.840
And I was actually a teacher before this.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.558
I taught in Los Angeles for seven years.

00:00:31.558 --> 00:00:34.100
So it's been really awesome just teaching here, leading field

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.720
trips, doing virtual programs.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:37.580
And yeah, just changing my classroom

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:39.920
from an actual classroom, really small

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.366
and enclosed to somewhere as beautiful as this.
